@api = http://localhost:5000

### Kiem tra API
GET {{api}}/

### 1. Tao tai lieu / ho so can phe duyet (draft) -> 201 Created
# @name create
POST {{api}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "De xuat mua thiet bi phong lab",
  "content": "Mua 10 may tinh cho phong thuc hanh.",
  "createdBy": "NV001",
  "approverCode": "QL001"
}

@id = {{create.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Danh sach tai lieu (loc: status, createdBy, approverCode)
GET {{api}}/documents?approverCode=QL001

### 3. Chi tiet tai lieu (kem lich su xu ly)
GET {{api}}/documents/{{id}}

### 4. Gui tai lieu: draft -> pending (phat su kien document.submitted)
POST {{api}}/documents/{{id}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "performedBy": "NV001" }

### 5a. Phe duyet: pending -> approved
POST {{api}}/documents/{{id}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reviewerCode": "QL001", "comment": "Dong y" }

### 5b. Tu choi: pending -> rejected (bat buoc co ly do)
POST {{api}}/documents/{{id}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reviewerCode": "QL001", "comment": "Thieu bao gia" }

### Loi 400: thieu tieu de
POST {{api}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "createdBy": "NV001", "approverCode": "QL001" }
